      "description": "Described as bipedal canine-like humanoids, the Lucario have garnered a reputation for being fiercesome melee fighters as well as coming across as arrogant and aloof in their few dealings with humanlikes Widely seen as violent isolationists, more patient and gifted individuals would find the Lucario more welcoming, having a natural sense of justice and trusting those who across time earned their loyalty It is from these exchanges that Lucario have been discovered to be telepathic, as well as able to sense and manipulate energies from all lifeforms, dubbed as 'Aura' by the Lucario themsleves The genesis of the Lucario are a mystery, even to the Lucario themselves Fragmentary accounts as well as DNA analysis of Lucario volunteers point to them being the product of glitterworld genetic engineering, likely for security or entertainment purposes How they became sentient or developed their telepathic abilites remains mysterious, though many stories tell of the Lucario (sometimes alongside their creators) travelling in ancient space vessels seeking a new home among the stars.",
      "defName": "DAKK_Lucario",
      "enabled": true,
      "name": "Lucario",
      "price": 4167
    },
