      "description": "Once mistaken as a seperate species, Riolu are actually the juvenile form of the Lucario Drawing from tales and legends concerning glitterworld technologies as well as the experiences imparted from the Lucario, it is now believed that some Lucario were bred specifically to retain their youthful features and obedient loyalty, giving rise to a sub-species who are smaller, weaker and more attractive Despite this, the Riolu still retain the determination and zeal of their parent bretheren.",
