      "description": "As formidable as the Lucario are, more recent rumours point to several Lucario individuals seeking to hone their skills and strengh even beyond that known Across the Rimworlds there has been at least one Lucario taking a long and difficult journey to a site rumoured to hold immense power Those that succeed return transformed, augmented with power and abilites previously thought impossible It also heralds their first step to becoming powerful leaders within their society, often measured in the aggression they unleash While fortunately few in number, Mega Lucario have been known to be resilient beyond measure and even more ruthless in battle, sometimes able to engage half a dozen soldiers all alone Only the most veteran of soldiers or overwhelming firepower would stand a chance to defeat such an opponent.",
