      "description": "Mincho is a slime-like race fully comprised of mintchoco ice cream.\n\nICEcRIM Co. created slime using mintchoco flavor ice cream with variant mechanite as an advertisement toy. However, due to an accidental mix-up during the final production stage, the wrong kind of variant, that was supposed to be disposed of due to critical defects, was used.\n\nMincho mimics human beings out of pure affection. They wish the humans to love them and \"consume\" them.\n\nDue to the simplicity of body composition, they are capable of regenerating even severed heads, resilient against diseases, and endures most fatal wounds.\n\nDifferences in the nerve system made them also immune to pain and psychic waves.\n\nHowever, Mincho is not capable of thinking, slow to learn and work, and weak against heat. \n\nWhen they are killed somehow (perhaps by having their core destroyed) they will turn into a lump of mintchoco ice cream.",
      "defName": "Mincho_ThingDef",
      "enabled": true,
      "name": "mincho",
      "price": 3333
    },
